    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the forward cargo door proximity sensing installation, showing the sill-mounted target plate, the outboard plate, the sensor lug and the protective sleeving at the sensor tail.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of the forward cargo door proximity sensing installation on the door sill and the adjacent door structure.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the sensing pair with the door open, looking aft from the sill. The target plate at item 10 is mounted on the sill on all delivered aircraft. Shims are not itemised: the stack is set per aircraft during installation and is ordered as a set from the shim reference on sheet 1. The sleeving at item 50 is cut to length on installation."
    },
